C label audit</a></p><h3 class="reading-heading--topic">Endpoint microscopy</h3></div>
 <p>The dataset contains 100 individual-channel images across 25 fields, 12 pre-existing merges and the experimental workbook. Individual channels are 2592 × 1944 pixels; fluorescence images are 8-bit pseudocolored exports. Measurements use the individual channels and the condition and field identifiers in the supplied source folders. The WL-MIC-01 reanalysis retains the original acquisition and single-experiment scope. Acquisition metadata, processing parameters and source-file checksums accompany the analysis.</p>
