., et al. (2023).</span> <span class="ref-title">High-throughput ligand profile characterization in novel cell lines expressing seven heterologous insect olfactory receptors for the detection of volatile plant biomarkers.</span> <span class="ref-venue">Scientific Reports 13, 21757.</span> <a href="https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-023-47455-4" rel="noopener noreferrer">Source</a>.<details class="ref-highlights"><summary>Source highlights</summary><div class="ref-highlights__body"><p>Provides a published heterologous OR/ORCO fluorescence-assay precedent. Its stable cell lines and validated protocol are separate from this transient, single-plate AeroSense pilot.</p></div></details><div class="ref-return-tools"><a class="ref-backlink" href="#cite-p2-zboray">Back to citation</a></div></li><li id="micro-ref-2" value="4"><span class="ref-authors">Thermo Fisher Scientific.</span> <span class="ref-title">DAPI solution: nuclear labeling and preparation limits.</span> <span class="ref-venue">Product guidance.</span> <a href="https://www.thermofisher.com/order/catalog/product/62248/faqs" rel="noopener noreferrer">Manufacturer documentation</a>.<details class="ref-highlights"><summary>Source highlights</summary><div class="ref-highlights__body"><ul><li>DAPI nuclear-labeling guidance relevant to preparation and denominator limits.</li></ul></div></details><div class="ref-return-tools"><a class="ref-backlink" href="#cite-auto-micro-ref-2-1">Back to citation</a></div></li><li id="micro-ref-4" value="5"><span class="ref-authors">Thermo Fisher Scientific.</span> <span class="ref-title">LIVE/DEAD cell viability assays.</span> <span class="ref-venue">Membrane-integrity and esterase-based measurements.</span> <a href="https://www.thermofisher.com/us/en/home/life-science/cell-analysis/cell-viability-and-regulation/cell-viability/live-dead-cell-viability-assays.html" rel="noopener noreferrer">Manufacturer documentation</a>.<details class="ref-highlights"><summary>Source highlights</summary>